Restoration note (0.15.0): the no-RankRotary accretive core and native MathDx
backend from e769a9a are restored. Notices describing Q/K/V, rotary kernels,
RMSNorm and gated readout below refer to earlier repository revisions; their
licenses are retained. Current vision reuses the historical residual CPE,
GELU scaffold with mean pooling and no LayerScale. The current core retains
equilibrium/complement modes; the content-conditioned generator and unused
materialized-frame CUDA interfaces have been removed.

